    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βηκία</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβάτια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.88
			</span></i>: but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βηκία</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βηκίον</span></b>  (which 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλελίσφακος</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.33
			</span></i>, and 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδοδίκταμνος</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				32
			</span></i>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βήχιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.112
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βηκώνιον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος βοτάνης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκ-</span>).</div>
